---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// probes.txt capture: pod A after /debug/unready -> READY 0/1, RESTARTS 0, ready=false
// in the EndpointSlice; pod B after /debug/hang -> "failed liveness probe, will be
// restarted", RESTARTS 1. Startup: "Startup probe failed" x3 while the app warmed up.
const W = 900, H = 330;
const cols = [
  { x: 40, icon: 'hourglass', t: { en: 'startup', vi: 'startup' }, q: { en: 'has it finished booting?', vi: 'boot xong chưa?' },
    f: { en: 'on failure: keep waiting', vi: 'khi fail: chờ tiếp' }, e: { en: 'capture: refused 3 times at boot', vi: 'capture: bị từ chối 3 lần lúc boot' } },
  { x: 330, icon: 'ok', t: { en: 'readiness', vi: 'readiness' }, q: { en: 'should traffic come here now?', vi: 'có nên gửi traffic vào đây lúc này?' },
    f: { en: 'on failure: leave the Service', vi: 'khi fail: rời khỏi Service' }, e: { en: 'capture: READY 0/1, RESTARTS 0', vi: 'capture: READY 0/1, RESTARTS 0' } },
  { x: 620, icon: 'retry', t: { en: 'liveness', vi: 'liveness' }, q: { en: 'is it stuck for good?', vi: 'nó kẹt hẳn chưa?' },
    f: { en: 'on failure: restart the container', vi: 'khi fail: khởi động lại container' }, e: { en: 'capture: RESTARTS 1 after a hang', vi: 'capture: RESTARTS 1 sau khi treo' }, red: true },
];
---
<figure class="bep12h">
  <div class="bep12h-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Three probes side by side. Startup asks whether the app finished booting and on failure keeps waiting. Readiness asks whether traffic should come now and on failure removes the pod from the Service without a restart. Liveness asks whether the process is stuck and on failure restarts the container, drawn in red because a wrong liveness check restarts healthy pods.">
    {cols.map((c) => (
      <g>
        <rect x={c.x} y="40" width="240" height="230" rx="10" class={c.red ? 'box bad' : 'box'} />
        <DiagramIcon name={c.icon} x={c.x + 34} y="76" size={26} />
        <text x={c.x + 66} y="82" class={c.red ? 't red' : 't'}><tspan data-lang-en>{c.t.en}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{c.t.vi}</tspan></text>
        <text x={c.x + 20} y="130" class="q"><tspan data-lang-en>{c.q.en}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{c.q.vi}</tspan></text>
        <text x={c.x + 20} y="176" class={c.red ? 'f red' : 'f'}><tspan data-lang-en>{c.f.en}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{c.f.vi}</tspan></text>
        <line x1={c.x + 20} y1="200" x2={c.x + 220} y2="200" class="axis" />
        <text x={c.x + 20} y="232" class="sm"><tspan data-lang-en>{c.e.en}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{c.e.vi}</tspan></text>
      </g>
    ))}
    <text x="40" y="304" class="note"><tspan data-lang-en>check dependencies in readiness, never in liveness: a down database must not restart healthy pods</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>kiểm tra dependency ở readiness, đừng ở liveness: database sập không được làm restart các pod khỏe</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Same HTTP check, three different consequences. The one that restarts things is the one to keep dumb.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Cùng một kiểu check HTTP nhưng ba hậu quả khác nhau. Cái có thể restart pod là cái nên giữ cho thật đơn giản.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep12h { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep12h-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep12h svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 760px; height: auto; }
  .bep12h text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .bep12h .t { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 16px; }
  .bep12h .q { fill: var(--text-body); }
  .bep12h .f { fill: var(--text); font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; }
  .bep12h .sm, .bep12h .note { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .bep12h text.red { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep12h .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep12h .box.bad { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2.2; }
  .bep12h .axis { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .bep12h figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
